<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CST started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CST started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said on Tuesday analysts Marcelo Chan and Alvaro Maia had started coverage of Brazilian steelmaker Companhia Siderurgica de Tubarao SA (CST) with a rating of market performer.</p>
<p>-- In a February 28 analysis, they set a 12-month price target of $18.86 per 1,000 of preferred shares, representing a dollar return of 17 percent.</p>
<p>-- CST preferred stock was off 0.15 real at 17.05 reais. The real closed at 1.0511 to the dollar on Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, 212 859-1879))</p>
</text>
